            "Many specialized neural-symbolic models have been proposed to solve SCAN \\citep{chen2020compositional,liu2020compositional, nye2020learning, shaw2021compositional, kim2021sequence}. We show that large language models with least-to-most prompting can solve SCAN using only a few demonstration examples. No training or finetuning is needed.\n",
