            "A: The output of ``jump left\" concatenates: the output of ``turn left\", the output of ``jump\". ``turn left\" outputs ``TURN\\_LEFT\". ``jump\" outputs ``JUMP\". So concatenating the output of ``turn left\" and the output of ``jump\" leads to ``TURN\\_LEFT\" + ``JUMP\". So the output of ``jump left\" is ``TURN\\_LEFT\" + ``JUMP\".\\\\\n",
