            "\\textbf{Chain-of-thought prompting}. The chain-of-thought prompt for SCAN uses the same command-mapping context as least-to-most prompting (see Table \\ref{table: scan-mapping}) but it does not use command decomposition, which is exclusively used for least-to-most prompting.\n",
