            "In Section~\\ref{sec:symbolic_manipulation} we mentioned that language model prompting can be used to decompose a word list such as ``think, machine, learning, reasoning'' into a sequence of subproblems ``think, machine'', ``think, machine, learning'', and ``think, machine, learning, reasoning''.\n",
